cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or code, please cite it as below."
title: "Aiwan-e-Jamhoor: Pakistan National Assembly elections, mapped (1977–2024)"
abstract: >-
  An open dataset and interactive map of Pakistan National Assembly general
  election results (1977, 1985, 1988, 1990, 1993, 1997, 2002, 2008, 2013, 2018,
  2024) on the constituency boundaries in force at each election, with
  candidate-level results and reconstructed, traced and digitised boundaries for
  the 200-seat, 207-seat, 2018 and 2023 delimitations.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Sameen
    given-names: Hiba
keywords:
  - Pakistan
  - elections
  - National Assembly
  - constituency boundaries
  - delimitation
  - electoral data
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
date-released: 2026-08-05
